  "question": "According to Executive Summary.pdf, what overall development duration, team size and rough budget does the executive summary estimate? Give all three estimates.",
  "result": {
    "answer": "- **Development duration / timeline:** Phased development over roughly 2\u20133 years (or ~24\u201330 months across ~3 phases) [S3][S4].\n- **Team size / staffing:** Roughly 10\u201315 people (including AI/ML engineers, software developers, content experts, QA, DevOps, and legal), with peak estimates of ~10\u201315 core team members (4\u20136 ML engineers, 4\u20136 software engineers, 2\u20133 content specialists/educators, 2 QA/SysOps, and part-time roles) [S1][S4].\n- **Budget / cost:** A rough budget on the order of $1M\u2013$5M over 2 years, or specifically $1.2M\u2013$2.0M for personnel over 2 years plus initial hardware of $300K and $200K/year for cloud [S1][S4].",
